{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1a6749db0581f421d4787ce29ab192635df42fcb68d2d0d582f2274f0075072a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d06d51f4f7496baa4996a2664516e4c76ddd3ea62fe121afb01fce5aaf598dc","slc_3ebad6cd6791de26304cfa33eae0026525f3befc7bdda4aaede91bad65691856","slc_54f2659a4a4ef933881c3739318f4c3ed4c06897577993a548298ede731ee1f6"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"Agent work state persists in git worktree-based 'Hooks' storage that survives crashes and restarts, and work items are stored in the Beads ledger, a git-backed issue tracking system.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_212bd080fbc62bc3b785f35d5e97905a6f69ddd6a4a7653cc55e219cfae559de","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b71c79a730f0dcd07996ceee2bb4b831ff2f19645e12deccb0275b0310e5de69","slc_cd00761886f63cd5710f00bc32eea61596967633ebaea8e57b6d89e90a1d104c"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"Native installs require Git 2.20+, Go 1.26.2+ (per go.mod), Beads (bd) 0.57.0+, sqlite3, ICU4C dev headers for source builds, tmux 3.0+ for tmux-backed roles, and a Claude Code CLI as the default runtime; Docker installs only need Docker Compose.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2676378cc7e03582cdae0c5f020d09cf4c83a85a3be246d134217e3bca93b898","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ccdfb00b460beb7a641ae585f2fcaca03ad271ab8b2c11d63b09b5e264b7f101"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"Bead/issue IDs use a prefix plus 5-character alphanumeric format (e.g. gt-abc12), where the prefix indicates the item's origin or rig; commands like gt sling and gt convoy accept these IDs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_40c914724c4bf780f0fcd63e00b4e037ff5f33902350ea7a31aeb8f05dd137d2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_500af074b5f26c63a1126dd33280c612afe0795cb4baaef15a0997c5c116ffed","slc_9a16527e53970d6150487587c33d98f11f3fcf03f1b018ba0e1b67618c278fcc","slc_f5b97795ca3e01efd267a25e6a82e0c69c16f2c483a32b8547b1062847c86077"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"The Refinery is a per-rig Bors-style merge queue: polecats run 'gt done' to create MR beads, the Refinery batches them, runs verification gates, and bisects failing batches; polecats never push directly to main.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_59af9cd3cecf2693aff698db0088b64986e4c6b9f26915b68ac863c0cf0e2463","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_145652263ea482b0e6d81acc38d6595f328b4974cf01fe35fcaf3f27bbeaeba1","slc_5fc4cd491fcd1146bb50291c36f628a2ee496c2e084b7b23bb142c3349680992","slc_c1aab89b0cea3bdc575c42a113bb562924646296d9481a93b299a004d7218f83","slc_faffb8011633a2fe6d3c6a5353621076ff60a25b4fe9d5bafdfb2b10dd9f4010"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"The architecture includes a Mayor AI coordinator, a Town workspace directory (e.g. ~/gt/), per-project Rigs wrapping git repositories, and Polecats (worker agents with persistent identity but ephemeral sessions).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66a13df9cd4a483f69646b172d92ae151b9cac8398b47c67c273da04d44e7669","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9d1b25596789515eb7bf3a88b56c87561f0a77fdce7ab08449798a07af0d084a"],"source_ids":["src_92e7cd4adc1358159089d775f558b57d"],"text":"A stated key design principle is loose coupling: Gas Town orchestrates agents through tmux and environment variables, without importing or linking agent libraries — integration is configuration, not compilation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6a7ee3f54121c1a2f058a35b05b3d797fe691568dc74221b65388832be43bf0a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5bb6b46c61e23d64ddecbe7a565f3b009909e91f8dfc388a198cad5030530786","slc_73cad17d3e4e848dc4212553caa22df072d8a14d14293e3e05e61991ed077b32","slc_ab7a72693c53ad281cb556d7516f1c2a8d41d7ecc18ebd3544fc0736f09596d7"],"source_ids":["src_92e7cd4adc1358159089d775f558b57d"],"text":"Agent provider integration is tiered: Tier 0 is zero-change tmux orchestration via send-keys and capture-pane, Tier 1 is a JSON preset in agents.json, Tier 2 adds hooks, and Tier 3 is deep native API integration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7b80926cc27e77495d454099cf1d7d29ea782c9feb2c5952542f0cc9d9213ffa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4df370026547ce58d158d12f1588004f98a15f67761e83500e06bf32328a6982","slc_80ef0a5a01a6a588a4cbfe2f669b4115b0a18236a6800101ca3ae224155d0c68","slc_9a9d0998b92f0936f91f2294fabbd31aaebf5217b3cd54721270f537fe638f0c","slc_cd9213f81fbe956b694f677553794d5943486052506c72b7f9b93bb35d4da13d"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"A three-tier watchdog system keeps agents healthy: per-rig Witnesses monitor polecats and trigger recovery, the Deacon runs continuous patrol cycles across rigs, and Dogs are dispatched for maintenance tasks like triage.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7d899e87a142e781f732b7f26b82c1906cf2104826e33347f74edc2bf452d1ca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_128a3fcd426108157d92fd33bc091419d47ca81475bd330682374ba7bbc5c7e2","slc_987e4d20ada863ca0335eb54083bb3d9f2d650895f59c92881b0ef048dfeaeb9","slc_d275d8fd9ae652b38942234187e094668caccd71927996646d613b7218f7a7bb"],"source_ids":["src_b843e5fe65c653e68282c2f305c6e317"],"text":"Runtime configuration is per-rig via settings/config.json with provider, command, args, and prompt_mode fields; built-in agent presets include claude, gemini, codex, kiro, cursor, auggie, amp, opencode, copilot, pi, and omp.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_950caac5142aeebb46830f211e4cb125520b8c743b587497c4e2ecb340a01b83","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"gastownhall/gastown@649b832b7672 snapshot 46e632c92880ab13","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0743f47b04c85fa1b0c23e5b7d2bcf21affb9de0aa02f48bc65fef196915fa6f","slc_4acd92992dceef2dfedb25d9de1ece9e9af5abad78770a989dcb00a58b4c817b"],"source_ids":["src_92e7cd4adc1358159089d775f558b57d"],"text":"The Tier 0 tmux shim layer is described as timing-sensitive with no delivery confirmation, lacking session resume, automatic context injection, and process-name detection compared to higher integration tiers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:52:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba5c4cdf45894fbd85d3bd5c9ab05fce"}
